 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_9f7ddfddfe75b56f47b8",
   "sourceHash": "9f7ddfddfe75b56f47b86f898259f8cdcd9aa497b2bd4304b2875c03f4c621c5",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Centre 是正宗与卓越的象征。这些中心的创立旨在向全世界传播阿育吠陀知识，它们恪守这一古老印度医学体系的原则，提供个性化治疗，在应对各类健康问题的同时促进整体健康。每项疗法都根据患者的需求量身定制，确保独特的体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ecfaa16429fc81353e9e",
   "sourceHash": "ecfaa16429fc81353e9e5eb7384a8b40d328b14beada3d8e74273e001ec0daef",
   "text": "广泛的中心网络",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fb1fddb2e4cb925a338d",
   "sourceHash": "fb1fddb2e4cb925a338dd24bd0a4f3226e9af63c04d87e4aba08807333537a8a",
   "text": "凭借 Kairali Ayurvedic Centre 在印度国内外的广泛布局，阿育吠陀得以惠及全球人群。这些中心将喀拉拉邦古老阿育吠陀疗法的精髓带到城市地区，为寻求整体、自然疗法的人们提供了一方栖息之所。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e3e8f254e96fd4c91bfb",
   "sourceHash": "e3e8f254e96fd4c91bfbceef1b853f360f1624bfde81cb11e328ec46c22737cd",
   "text": "特色阿育吠陀治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03e46e273b2eb3f5f9c9",
   "sourceHash": "03e46e273b2eb3f5f9c9e27ea53d690d2eb2d3f37cb636511b8c42f89b453a5f",
   "text": "为满足各种健康需求，Kairali Ayurvedic Centre 提供种类广泛的疗法和治疗项目。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a169022bb102ac91f48",
   "sourceHash": "2a169022bb102ac91f48e0a0380a213212c9c39e2d71dc9e089d2faf3c45f04c",
   "text": "：Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）是一种使用治疗用油进行的传统全身按摩，可促进血液循环、减轻压力并为身体排毒。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5d686cbdb92bd80b5269",
   "sourceHash": "5d686cbdb92bd80b5269415fe343516eed33d08e05e0bdbbc360f5c9442dc19f",
   "text": "Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）：Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）是一种使用治疗用油进行的传统全身按摩，可促进血液循环、减轻压力并为身体排毒。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b081800e10f370fae981",
   "sourceHash": "b081800e10f370fae98199102f6d1e834c8997e0a1fba13a51ebf92a6ef706e2",
   "text": "：Shirodhara（希罗达拉）是一种令人放松的治疗，将温热的油以持续细流浇淋于前额，以缓解焦虑、改善睡眠和提升思维清晰度而闻名。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e79911b2064fc9f3f9b1",
   "sourceHash": "e79911b2064fc9f3f9b14c5fa30f35ae45916f85f7da609a325bd007466d2f0e",
   "text": "Shirodhara（希罗达拉）：Shirodhara（希罗达拉）是一种令人放松的治疗，将温热的油以持续细流浇淋于前额，以缓解焦虑、改善睡眠和提升思维清晰度而闻名。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8fb32c9c4e86e9269e34",
   "sourceHash": "8fb32c9c4e86e9269e34e3a0fca12b01e4d86eea4dba527602d4b18d624b42c8",
   "text": "：皮兹奇尔（Pizhichil）有时被称为“王者疗法”，将同步按摩与轻柔的淋油相结合，带来深度放松与焕新。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c517f7dfd6debd6c8017",
   "sourceHash": "c517f7dfd6debd6c8017b3d9879188d96269d8a25853a99f99b77197e2ba8d18",
   "text": "皮兹奇尔（Pizhichil）：皮兹奇尔有时被称为“王者疗法”，将同步按摩与轻柔的淋油相结合，带来深度放松与焕新。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
