   "sourceHash": "a2fae868b853a9efa9ed362c1392f50bfc564480db9d741995c3d11fb2037bc5",
   "text": "Kizhi（基兹）疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2c274be6580554149cdc",
   "sourceHash": "2c274be6580554149cdc93c0f9bce0fbc87185f0bb42569a42184d26ff1c9caa",
   "text": "：该疗法使用草药敷包来减轻疼痛、增加关节活动度并净化身体。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
