   "sourceHash": "3ab7fac3da12e483e982180d26b77ed680db8cd15bb830574449e7c298b560fc",
   "text": "Kizhi（基兹）疗法：该疗法使用草药敷包来减轻疼痛、增加关节活动度并净化身体。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
