   "sourceHash": "7cf1bb4a574e80c436316f287b7767cc7e9ca6344b984314e1db52be3eaf6e29",
   "text": "：潘查卡玛（Panchakarma）是一套全面的阿育吠陀排毒疗程，可平衡多沙（doshas）、清除体内杂质并使身体焕发活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
